From d2f8d66ae2d3f5d00d543b0f7c82eb673428c2e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Midhun <midhun1234@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 21 Jun 2026 18:21:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SEO overhaul + Projects sidebar with stage filter & sort
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

UI
- Add Localities/Projects mode toggle in the left sidebar.
- Projects mode: discrete sort buttons (recently added, stage, builder,
  locality, type) + an independent direction toggle (no shift-click).
- Stage filter chips with per-stage counts: All / Launched / Pre-launch
  / Building / Announced / Upcoming. Status badges in rows.

SEO
- robots.txt: real flatmap.cloud sitemap, disallow /api/, block GPTBot,
  CCBot, Bytespider, ClaudeBot.
- sitemap.xml: 300 URLs (home, 3D, areas/projects/heat hubs, all 127
  locality pages, all 168 project pages) with lastmod/changefreq.
- Static landing pages (no JS required for crawlers):
  * /l/<slug>.html × 127 — per-locality prices, livability, nearest
    new launches and metro stations, cross-links to siblings in zone.
    JSON-LD: Place + BreadcrumbList.
  * /p/<slug>.html × 168 — per-project builder, stage, type, price,
    nearest locality context, other projects by same builder.
    JSON-LD: Residence + BreadcrumbList.
  * /areas/ — zonal hub of all 127 localities.
  * /projects/ — builder-grouped hub of all 168 launches.
  * /heat/ — evergreen Heat-index article. JSON-LD: Article.
- index.html:
  * Replaced YOUR-DOMAIN.vercel.app placeholder with flatmap.cloud.
  * og-cover.svg (1200x630) referenced in OG + Twitter
    summary_large_image.
  * 6 JSON-LD blocks: WebSite (SearchAction), WebApplication,
    Dataset (with downloadable JSON distributions), FAQPage (6 Q&As),
    BreadcrumbList, Organization.
  * Geo meta (geo.region IN-KA, geo.position, ICBM).
  * preconnect/dns-prefetch for unpkg, cdnjs, basemaps.cartocdn.
  * <noscript> block with full A-Z list of every locality and project
    for crawlers and JS-off users.
- og-cover.svg: branded 1200x630 cover image.
- vercel.json: long cache headers for /l, /p, /areas, /projects, /heat;
  CORS open on /data; 301 redirects from older URL shapes; FLoC opt-out.
- app.js: ?locality=<slug> and ?project=<slug> deep-link handlers so
  search-engine clicks land on the right view in the SPA.
